### function name glued to the brace
function greet{
  echo hello
}
>>- SC1095 1:15 -- mvdan rejects this input, so it is reported as a syntax error, not as a lint code at the closing brace

### function name with a space before the brace
function greet {
  echo hello
}
>>> none

### function name followed by parentheses
function greet() {
  echo hello
}
>>> none
